  "description": {
   "en": "The latest work from Yamada, creator of Tashiro-kun, Kimi tte Yatsu wa, featured in onBLUE vol.72, is finally available digitally!\nA short but sweet 11-page high school BL story unfolds as class rep Nanoka gets roped into asking the stunning new transfer student, Ayami, a series of flirty questions at the insistence of his classmates. But when Nanoka finally works up the nerve, Ayami fixes him with an intense gaze and smirks—\n\"A class rep with that many piercings? That’s pretty willful, huh?\"\nA heart-throbbing love story between an unintentional flirt and an enchanting transfer student!"
  },
